{"articleNo":"226506","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=226506&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2019년 정읍시민장학재단 장학생 선발계획 안내 [기간 연장]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.07.08","hit":"4374","attachments":[{"name":"2019년 정읍시민장학재단 장학생 선발 공고문(접수기간 연장).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=226506&attachNo=80902"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><strong>2019년 정읍시민장학재단 장학생 선발계획 안내</strong></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">정읍시 </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">우수인재 육성을 위해 설립된 (재)정읍시민장학재단의 2019년 장학생 선발계획을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 많은 신청바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 접수기간 : 2019.7.8.(월) ~7.22.(월) 18시까지,&nbsp;토일</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">제외</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* <span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">당초 접수기간 : 7.8.(월)~7.15.(월), 7일 연장</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2. 접 수 처 : 주소지(정읍시) 읍, 면, 동사무소</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3. 대 상 자 : 공고일 기준 정읍시에 2년이상 주소를 두고 있는 부 또는 모의 자녀로, 전국 대학교 재학생</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임&nbsp;&nbsp;2019년 정읍시민장학재단 장학생 선발 공고문 1부.</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
